# Xcode. `build/` above already covers DerivedData and the framework Gradle stages for it,
# since Scripts/ios-sim.sh keeps both there. What is left is per-user state Xcode writes
# *inside* the project bundle -- the shared scheme beside it is committed and is what
# `xcodebuild -scheme Photos` resolves.
app/ios/Photos.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
app/ios/Photos.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

